  "sourceTitle": "Crossing the Threshold: How OpenAI and Anthropic Approach Autonomy and Safety in Financial Agents",
  "sourceBodyHash": "832620855fb2057822c1a9e9d91be5c0c788b384ce0d504cad779913555f20a6",
